Project Briefs: Built to Close Gaps for NPCI (and Read Well for FAANG)

Two projects below. Project 1 is the priority — it directly answers three JD bullets (Graph AI, fraud/AML, GPU acceleration) that your resume currently has zero coverage for. Project 2 upgrades something you already have (NextChapter) into an explicitly agentic system, which is now table stakes for GenAI-adjacent roles at FAANG too.

